# CODEOWNERS - Define who should review specific files
# Learn more: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Security-sensitive files require security team review
/SECURITY.md                          @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/.github/workflows/*                  @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/.github/dependabot.yml               @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/.github/dependency-review-config.yml @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/docs/security/*                      @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/docs/SCORECARD_SETUP.md              @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/docs/GITHUB_TEAMS_SECURITY_SETUP.md  @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team

# Dependency files require security review
/package.json                         @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/package-lock.json                    @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/requirements.txt                     @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/go.mod                               @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/go.sum                               @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/Gemfile                              @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team
/Gemfile.lock                         @GeeksikhSecurity/security-team

# Default: all files
# Note: Replace with your actual team/username
*                                     @GeeksikhSecurity
